  <item>
    <title>SEVENTEEN仁川安可演唱会repo：一不小心见证了历史，结果我的脑子当场宕机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d941dee2c8be3155e5cbe0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d941dee2c8be3155e5cbe0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 19:37:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmgAAFybhZ6Ij1hJ951EZNynn7p.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>抢票始末：</span></strong><span>想着大概不去了吧，结果余票很多，心态改变结果，而且签证也一切顺利，就这样实现末场全勤；</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>同担际遇</span></strong><span>：不远千里前来的法国女人，全程冷静捂得严严实实疑似狗仔的同担，热情分享物料、帮忙拍照，熊猫妹help熊猫妹；也遇到了非常多很好的韩国人；</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>演唱会全肯定：</span></strong><span>（悲剧时刻）被音箱挡住俊开场的拍摄；上厕所偶遇圆佑却没认出净汉；没狙到hit脱衣的俊尼；当场听到续约消息结果没听懂；（可爱时刻）超级会模仿克拉边啦啦啦边穿雨衣的胜宽；（帅气时刻）一个个点名表扬，大屏的神崔胜澈、脱衣有肉徐明浩、西装战神金珉奎、西装弹吉他崔瀚率、忙内美李灿，帅成什么样了；洪知秀、文俊辉你们的身材很曼妙，美成啥样了这是；夫胜宽、李硕珉，别太可爱了，还有prettywoman时候的CM，绝了，家人们，谁懂啊；（设备测评）vivo x300真的很不错；</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>首尔觅食记：</span></strong><span>这次终于能好好吃饭了，推荐釜饭，给到夯；mega下次不喝了，喷射神器；</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>一首歌总结这次的仁川安可演唱会</span></strong><span>：今 -明日 世界が終わっても- (现在-即使明天是世界末日-)“比一切更为重要的是 我们的现在”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll0XMxqxQkIy26eS_UhbZtSes3_u.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFumOlHo9C066Dy8hAk41dKAtfG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnO2J1UkP1mcrwRSOyHhe3S-FcQl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-qNsJJtmKwA7udjpUNN7NM5bl8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpXnZWXTJeoIGLOZbDGsVUiXLpkO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoakhfIMryXJ_vi5XNVQ4OiWujmH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp9KyojNj7V7_httmiPe5hyXV1TQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutD1C_j_KWP9gR1R32c8AcnJIHE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnVhPlvzgJSc4E2WMe8fpkwVCJrh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：知之 嘉宾：懒懒（超级感谢！！！）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：SEVENTEEN-Tiny Light；JUN-gemini；vernon-shiningstar；夫胜宽-raindrops；CM-pretty woman；今 -明日 世界が終わっても- (现在-即使明天是世界末日-)</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>往期回顾：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b1cc405faf36865913525c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b1cc405faf36865913525c"><strong><span>我选择SVT仁川演唱会作为我的解药（又名克拉妹抢票血泪史）</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ebb1f4224325ea70dc430d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ebb1f4224325ea70dc430d"><strong><span>“因为你们，我很幸福”有什么痛苦等我9月份看完两场SEVENTEEN的线下演唱会再说</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b44774772ac2295b170acd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b44774772ac2295b170acd"><strong><span>一个人去香港看SEVENTEEN安可演唱会，我经历了什么</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d52722e2c8be31559db27d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d52722e2c8be31559db27d"><strong><span>SEVENTEEN曼谷演唱会repo：与19岁相遇的密友，在『9-TEEN』的歌声中回忆属于我们仅此一次的盛大青春</span></strong></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmWH6ssXbmTMV9FVdaPih5Mbwzz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
