    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6946b29ce0674912edf5e8b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6946b29ce0674912edf5e8b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 14:39:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期由喜欢《疯狂动物城2》的发发和非粉Lucy展开对（辩）话（论）</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家喜欢《疯狂动物城》里的哪个角色呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（叠甲：非专业影评，漫谈交流性质，很多废话，友好评论）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 动物城是“合友欢”电影</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a>和第一部相比怎么样？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>发发：剧情在意料之中、译制有本土特色</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucy：盖瑞蛇的“真面目”可以延迟出现，情节没有第一部丰富</span></p><span></span><p><span>发发：第一部犯罪暴力出彩，第二部精神压力较重</span></p><span></span><p><span>把第一部的矛盾加码，会让观众审美疲劳吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>发发：第一部胜在剧情，续集侧重人物塑造（《罗小黑战记》系列同）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2872">47:52</a>怎么看待第二部的兔狐关系？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>发发：我磕的是cb向，他们不是情侣</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucy：“你守护世界我守护你”很俗套……</span></p><span></span><p><span>发发：就像孙悟空和猪八戒，是取长补短、相互融合的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucy更喜欢朱迪，发发更喜欢尼克</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5173">1:26:13</a>一些细节、彩蛋</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>夏奇羊的角是雄性的角</span></p><span></span><p><span>豹子警官、狸宝、朱迪邻居的取向</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5466">1:31:06</a>最喜欢动物城里哪个角色？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>发发：尼克</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucy：羊市长、阔耳狐、教父一家</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5718">1:35:18</a>对粤配版黄子华配音尼克的看法？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>发发：子华神配音加深了对尼克的喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lucy：黄子华配得较老成</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Zoo（《疯狂动物城2》主题曲）</span></p><span></span><p><span>容祖儿、黄子华：《疯狂动物城1》粤配版节选（是发发的私心~）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtV7ZpZMu5HXdiTVE1ov6IyG4F6Y.jpg