  <item>
    <title>“因为你们，我很幸福”有什么痛苦等我9月份看完两场SEVENTEEN的线下演唱会再说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ebb1f4224325ea70dc430d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ebb1f4224325ea70dc430d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Oct 2025 13:57:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>没有shownotes，想说的都在节目正片和图里，请大家多多关心吧！</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>仁川场：</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp0OL7xOwv3zHbZWQT4AFZScjEo8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>弘大地铁偶遇的应援大屏↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FseXtY5yElrSOlnzmQ6SLHdgbM59.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>来坐接驳车啦，一下地铁就看到了工作人员的指示↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvTJgLzMovaVCTPcoT9S7ICoJLj2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>领到手环了↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqarjavbD67ejMtRK5_P2b46QvV7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>千辛万苦领到的zone卡↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGdZrpyvFXqmvwHJLE-0lhDJUjr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>山顶风景一览图↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lltR1dNQ2qSyNULE_9YNyW3oBfRy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一大波次人的帅照来袭（仁川大屏真的还是太好拍了，神图一拍一个不吱声）↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj8F9ELl2k_pT2A5Ax4cxwzMyUlg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>太可爱了太可爱了！到底是谁发明的夫胜宽!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FigdmrXHsIf_CviWFA-3_tTF_Sqv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiz1yssJvSkO0BH5Ev3DmpFbOoKm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>金珉奎是全世界最可爱的小狗，不许反驳！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoYE2TIs2RJaRSqJ1riBtcrFsbAD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWcP2B-Tgh6RBQgFF-eo2MZ-P-Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>好了，文俊辉你是最棒的小猫！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIgkK3ejDC3nD3Mk9azmXAZDqnr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjj0Ii0wVB8KpnYjhW9r6CLwjauM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>哈哈哈哈哈，怎么会有男人长得那么帅又那么会Bking啊！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ludzXoLGIpCK54MJ0WNQzSKcMPcp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Joshua啊，我们也爱你！（汪汪汪）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lheqGl4Cmp9Ok2e7Sgpbog4IMDUR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>8的这个造型美到没边了！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjkTL4yppP3DqZIz0pv8NBuYOPRF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>怎么发型这么适配，给Cody大鸡腿！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmnOSuyiBLCB8lxqI4wzoIuDCTP5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>C×M小分队大发吧！（请大家多多支持我们六代新人小分队新专！真的好好听！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrtTD96ZandBB5mkVJaZRLBOBMHL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>率宽呐！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZG8MQOKYRBI3oX1ae4RYh74uPk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>猪蹄不怎么样但是草莓米酒好好喝↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpudKS-onRHXi0xIba1nUH1gN0f_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>量大管饱但是根本吃不完↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnUuzZufV43J_wkQdd3SfBOcZVWS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>同担吃饭主打一个小卡先吃↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrR4X83O_gtVogWF4YXZLQYQbJKa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在首尔喝上瘾的草莓牛奶，回国还在淘宝下单了↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkznJnbmutQBFzU5CyCPLB31lKD1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在地铁拍照被路过的大叔问是不是SEVENTEEN，次人你们是真的火啊！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lq-cO_PxKDsfrTFpiBfSzL_lsWnh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>圣水洞偶遇的天使欧巴尹净汉（汉呐，想你了，速归！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsfWjrdQXsM6e5oyfIMPhEPjvfPw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>弘大阿迪拿下的最后一件华夫格外套↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnk4XkbFMj9ok9DlJrY26xGAVx_H.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>满大街随处可见的mega coffee，速速下单体验↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmt6WfiJW93dax1FHDpnfIC3JKtR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>随处可见的金影响力（不得不说洗发水和发膜是真好用啊！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoHGF9ubNncismiegN1W7YsoLce2.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>香港场：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>场馆也是应援色！（一开始以为是特地变成这个颜色来着哈哈哈）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdN9k10IAhlcEBPB6HOHVK7rpV4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>维多利亚的风这辈子都不愿意感受了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>zone卡换到mingyu啦哈哈哈哈超级开心！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsxaQhfiZjAYwAZwDyAN0P9OkKsC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>吃饱吃饱才有力气追线下↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FioPTdoU77llUZraYFpo8NvO3l7m.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>登基位视角（赞赞）↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpaMEBDkO_UPo1oyXd805zqb6d2o.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大屏实在拍不到啥了，但是现场的氛围真的很好，期待你们下次安可场再来哟！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqwkXwpPKTOB2-2y0fMQuDd4QWJU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsafLhVfCI5wWP8ziCxcoSiKJ9v1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：知之 &nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：LIN&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：SEVENTEEN-HBD；C×M（SEVENTEEN）-young again</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmWH6ssXbmTMV9FVdaPih5Mbwzz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/644a7fc9e6c67b9b1e518ee3/ljYsLvrd2eAEUSox1OZclJ26TAbP.m4a" length="54629199" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrqYFXtUF-OgBHjIcWLK0H7nPXIv.png"/>
