  <item>
    <title>重看《情色小说家》【吴哥窟树洞26】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68daa6ecb4befcf73086f97b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68daa6ecb4befcf73086f97b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Sep 2025 23:10:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天凉了又开始重看小说家，寻找喜欢三三的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f38d35f9578163d684015a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f38d35f9578163d684015a"><span>那些年我们一起看过的“纯爱”作品【吴哥窟树洞22】</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 和小说家的相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 小说家系列讲了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a> 重看的有趣的点：</span></p><span></span><p><span>极其克制的叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音：配乐、自然音、片尾曲、三三勾人的尾音</span></p><span></span><p><span>电车和蝉的意象，城户和久住对峙的镜头，昏黄的滤镜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a>三三的魅力：</span></p><span></span><p><span>住在昭和时代的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>极高雅的艺术品位和极世俗的谋生手段</span></p><span></span><p><span>他的文学理想还长存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a>城户和久住互为对照组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a>对剧场版的释怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a>真人“售后”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2521">42:01</a>“纯爱”作品受众：对两性关系的失望和拒斥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a>最近看的两部：日腐《雨后天晴的我们》、泰百《only you》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDjZ6V2pChF0Z1SbtIVOyK4C28r.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaLuFYcmk3hX8u_05ol4N7oHmNU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（图源网络）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《情色小说家》OST</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7zKpFT2v8gJfjbs8w7gw2bLRFu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（图源网络）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、文案、后期：发发</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/644a7fc9e6c67b9b1e518ee3/lpneTN2CJTO5WqZx-34CRvD2siqX.m4a" length="54886475" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FslK7RU84VCzKraskRLpgEh_jvkt.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
