  <item>
    <title>57 日本、港迪、广州行：来自韩国留子的不完全指北</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6890830a8e06fe8de740f63c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6890830a8e06fe8de740f63c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Aug 2025 10:23:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Lin作为主讲人，知之和发发作为提问者和倾听者，get去日本、港迪、广州旅游的景点安利和出行贴士</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第一部分：日本：大阪环球——秋叶原——富士山</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 行前准备：签证、护照、插头、交通等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 大阪环球：去过游乐园中情绪价值最足的一个，请去！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 秋叶原：动漫周边、女仆咖啡厅……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> 富士山：不要住在山附近&amp;最好自由行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 新宿歌舞伎町：牛郎店一条街、女生容易被尾随</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 三天日本行的花销：住、行、吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1978">32:58</a> 富士山的河马巴士值得一看！（需提前一个月预约）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2059">34:19</a> 语言不通怎么办：请用最简单的词交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 日本和日本人很像动漫/日剧的时刻&amp;值得一夸的点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2708">45:08</a> 再去日本还想去哪：北海道看雪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> 做梦时刻：发发怎么规划东京、京都、奈良游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3555">59:15</a> 知之想去日本做的事：看花火大会、去优衣库大楼、在东蛋看演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第二部分：港迪</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3977">01:06:17</a> 排队最短的游乐园：先冲冰雪奇缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4219">01:10:19</a> 和第一次去有什么不同的感受</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第三部分：广州</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4569">01:16:09</a> 省博、粤剧博物馆、十三行博物馆；大佛寺抄经</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4776">01:19:36</a> city walk路线推荐：正佳、六运——广州塔、海心沙——水上巴士——中山大学——沙面——人民桥（看日落）——粤海关博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5662">01:34:22</a> 潮到风湿东山口、永庆坊月亮桥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5800">01:36:40</a> 好吃推荐：喜茶蛋糕冰淇淋、寿司郎、萨莉亚、点都德虾饺妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6117">01:41:57</a> 出行tips：胆大心细</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家都能去到想去的地方！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodXwVN_kSvzcGjAk8u6axR2ow0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkN5PsAexWcP9Uau_H7W-j3Z6Wbo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（感谢Lin提供的J人版攻略表）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>SEVETEEN：Sara Sara</span></p><span></span><p><span>三代目 J SOUL BROTHERS：线香花火</span></p><span></span><p><span>FANTASTICS：Summer Drops</span></p><span></span><p><span>SEVETEEN：Where Love Passed</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsbo79Eq90vU6kczBaUYbgWliJMe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>主播：知之、发发</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Lin</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期、文案：发发</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/644a7fc9e6c67b9b1e518ee3/lloLFfG3jmP5a2K48R9ZCBOxXSDA.m4a" length="111967750" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:53:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlIUW_g0oJGZz_QnFXi3XifvKr7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>56【毕业第四弹】一些心流时刻和灵性实践【吴可窟树洞26】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68862733a12f9ff06a47a069</link>
